WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.240
Before you start

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:27.280
Step 1 — Start the half-round frame

00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:42.320
Steps 2 and 3 — Fasten one side and add the next leg unit

00:00:42.320 --> 00:00:56.720
Steps 4 and 5 — Complete and bolt the half-round frame

00:00:56.720 --> 00:01:11.440
Steps 6 and 7 — Attach the half-round tabletop

00:01:11.440 --> 00:01:23.640
Step 8 — Level the half-round table

00:01:23.640 --> 00:01:37.960
Steps 1 and 2 — Start the rectangular frame

00:01:37.960 --> 00:01:50.600
Steps 3 and 4 — Complete and bolt the rectangular frame

00:01:50.600 --> 00:02:04.440
Steps 5 and 6 — Prepare and attach the rectangular tabletop

00:02:04.440 --> 00:02:17.280
Steps 7 and 8 — Lock the tabletop and level the table

00:02:17.280 --> 00:02:31.680
Step 9 — Fit the cable outlet and join tables if needed
